#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<fgetwc> function returns the next wide-character from the stream, "
#| "or WEOF."
msgid ""
"On success, B<fgetwc>()  returns the next wide-character from the stream.  "
"Otherwise, B<WEOF> is returned, and I<errno> is set to indicate the error."
msgstr ""
"La función B<fgetwc> devuelve el siguiente carácter ancho del flujo o WEOF."

